# Merge App

A web application for merging data from Excel, CSV, TXT, and FASTA files.  
Supports:
- FASTA parsing (accession, description, sequence)
- Using one FASTA/info file to annotate many target files
- Interactive column selection
- Preview of parsed and merged data
- Batch merging of multiple files

## Running locally
pip install -r requirements.txt
streamlit run merge_app.py

## Deploying on Streamlit Cloud
1. Create a new app at https://share.streamlit.io
2. Select this repository
3. Set main file to merge_app.py
